          "text": "Japan and the US are in talks for a ¥2–3 trillion (up to US$19.3 billion) chip fab in the US to be operated by GlobalFoundries, Nikkei Asia reports, seen as a project from Japan’s US$550 billion tariff-related US investment commitment.  $GFS  #semiconductors",
